cf","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/xai-org-grok-build-f4a8cca75fcf.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"xai-org/grok-build","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:23:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8fd12ba8f0d243b8900ea83c3268e98e"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_03233ce2afee4b086aee14b66554b2e553394ef4bafdb6866179056f22afbbb7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Grok Build runs as a full-screen terminal TUI that can edit files, execute shell commands, search the web, and manage long-running tasks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0d949c7c81fa853fd90900567996a059eaa3712bf1253b0d9ea78955fc67042d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository is periodically synced from the SpaceXAI monorepo, with a SOURCE_REV file recording the full monorepo commit SHA."},{"claim_ids":["clm_28bc28297f9e61b03eca1e73dc4ed9bd1bc73cf082bafaa099cc32669816fc18"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: per-crate cargo check/test/clippy and cargo fmt are the documented build, test, and lint commands; clippy.toml and rustfmt.toml sit at the repo root."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6179ddee55b5672cb65474f5e6b4344705d74e621a5ecf91d875bf23c90675c9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Windows builds of the project are described as best-effort and not currently tested from this tree; macOS and Linux are supported build hosts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8dd4d24ebb08df51505872ed9d207ba4315bd1281035babda6f735266b9b232e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Third-party notices indicate in-tree source ports of openai/codex and sst/opencode tool implementations, plus a vendored Mermaid diagram stack under third_party/."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b10d053ad46e68b0966a9cb4e47e5105824628f9f06660764d87482cd8b2323d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent can run interactively, headlessly for scripting/CI, or embedded in editors via the Agent Client Protocol (ACP)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dad7feef462f57480a32a7119937d7a5b60cfc4038dc3a74efeaa35607f82ea5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the root Cargo.toml is generated and should be treated as read-only; contributors should edit per-crate Cargo.toml files instead."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e763dc42fcec493521723695da5a87096392782b654b9c229f3e73eb56a4d2ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Building from source requires a Rust toolchain pinned by rust-toolchain.toml and DotSlash so hermetic tools like bin/protoc can run."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ec03aaed84c67c35bd51b479b0a242f82fbf0be9e43eed559f5906636b766d1b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repo contains Rust source for the grok CLI/TUI and agent runtime, with crates for the TUI, agent runtime, tools, and workspace (filesystem, VCS, checkpoints)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f043b536a806d0a27e93f8454399ebf157d50c0a70744fa116f647a65324721f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Prebuilt binaries are published for macOS, Linux, and Windows via install scripts, and the binary authenticates by opening a browser on first launch."}],"claim_ids":["clm_03233ce2afee4b086aee14b66554b2e553394ef4bafdb6866179056f22afbbb7","clm_0d949c7c81fa853fd90900567996a059eaa3712bf1253b0d9ea78955fc67042d","clm_28bc28297f9e61b03eca1e73dc4ed9bd1bc73cf082bafaa099cc32669816fc18","clm_6179ddee55b5672cb65474f5e6b4344705d74e621a5ecf91d875bf23c90675c9","clm_8dd4d24ebb08df51505872ed9d207ba4315bd1281035babda6f735266b9b232e","clm_b10d053ad46e68b0966a9cb4e47e5105824628f9f06660764d87482cd8b2323d","clm_dad7feef462f57480a32a7119937d7a5b60cfc4038dc3a74efeaa35607f82ea5","clm_e763dc42fcec493521723695da5a87096392782b654b9c229f3e73eb56a4d2ba","clm_ec03aaed84c67c35bd51b479b0a242f82fbf0be9e43eed559f5906636b766d1b","clm_f043b536a806d0a27e93f8454399ebf157d50c0a70744fa116f647a65324721f"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:23:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_8fd12ba8f0d243b8900ea83c3268e98e","id":"pg_737db92ccfb950968499c0474f5a50f4","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/xai-org-grok-build-readme-md-37949780c144-c0474f5a50f4.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_26b0312db21c5d4ea9381c6f6834725c"],"title":"xai-org/grok-build/README.md @ 37949780c144","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:23:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8fd12ba8f0d243b8900ea83c3268e98e"}
